('Wennovation Hub', 'Pioneer Nigerian innovation accelerator focused on social impact sectors: agriculture, healthcare, education, clean energy, and infrastructure.', 'Social impact, agritech, healthtech', 'Lagos', false, 'https://wennovation.com', 'https://logo.clearbit.com/wennovation.com', true),
